# Enable Your Certificate

To sign up or post jewels, your Gemini client needs to send a client certificate.

## How to enable it
Most Gemini clients will prompt you to create or select a certificate when a site requests one. If yours doesn't:

* Lagrange: Settings → Identity → Create a new identity
* Amfora: It will prompt automatically
* Kristall: Certificate manager in the toolbar

Once your certificate is active, try signing up again.

=> /signup Sign up
=> / ← Home
